# Azure DevOps only

CI and CD run only in Azure DevOps. `azure-pipelines.yml` is test-only. `azure-pipelines-cd.yml` is the only deploy pipeline. It stays manual and gated. Do not dispatch it until `docs/cost-tracker.md` is approved.

GitHub Actions is disabled. Do not add `pull_request`, `push`, or `schedule` under `.github/workflows/`. Do not remove `if: ${{ false }}` from those jobs. Do not dispatch the GitHub `ci` or `cd` workflows.

Do not add `databricks bundle deploy` to `azure-pipelines.yml`.
